#, python-format
msgid "A daily billing task walks the estate and notifies the store owner at three points: an expiry warning %(warn)s days before the term ends, an expired notice the day after it lapses, and — %(grace)s days past the term end — suspension. Each stage is sent at most once per term; the expired and suspension notices also copy the platform admins."
msgstr "A daily billing task walks the estate and notifies the store owner at three points: an expiry warning %(warn)s days before the term ends, an expired notice the day after it lapses, and — %(grace)s days past the term end — suspension. Each stage is sent at most once per term; the expired and suspension notices also copy the platform admins."

msgid "A dispute is open on this payment and the payment provider does not accept a refund until it is decided. Refund once it has closed."
