msgid "A legal page keeps its slug: the storefront serves it at a fixed address, and checkout records it by that slug."
msgstr "A legal page keeps its slug: the storefront serves it at a fixed address, and checkout records it by that slug."

msgid "A legal page must be published now, not scheduled for later: the storefront hides it until then, and checkout refuses every order meanwhile."
msgstr "A legal page must be published now, not scheduled for later: the storefront hides it until then, and checkout refuses every order meanwhile."

msgid "A legal page must stay published: the storefront hides it, and checkout refuses every order while the terms of use or privacy policy cannot be shown. Edit its text instead."
msgstr "A legal page must stay published: the storefront hides it, and checkout refuses every order while the terms of use or privacy policy cannot be shown. Edit its text instead."

msgid "A legal page needs a body in every language the store serves: the storefront shows nothing in that language, and checkout refuses every order there."
msgstr "A legal page needs a body in every language the store serves: the storefront shows nothing in that language, and checkout refuses every order there."

msgid "A lost dispute took money back; say whether the goods came back. Returned or not delivered credits the receipt (retail credit document), as a refund does. The customer keeping the goods leaves the sale as it is."
